  "details": "Reading input from an Oculus device (e.g. current trigger position) in Udon has a big delay (above 1 second), while VRChat itself has no such issue and registers the button input immediately in the menu etc. \n\nThis is only the case if that HMD is being used through Oculus Home, not when the same device is used through SteamVR. This issue was reported by multiple users to me now.",
